
{% block page_title %}About Us{% endblock %}

{% block content %}


<link rel="stylesheet" href="Style.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="About-us.css">
<body>
{% include 'navbar.twig' %}
<br><br><br>
<div class="container">
    <div class="logo">
        {% include 'layout.twig' %}
        <img src ="pizza.jpeg" alt="Pizza" width="275" height="183" style="position:relative; margin-top:-20px;">
        <img src = "caeser-salad.jpg" alt="Caesar Salad" width="275" height="183" style="position:relative; margin-top:-30px;">
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <h1>CampusEats - How it came to be</h1>
        <p>The newfound legacy of CampusEats began in early 2021 when the university of Malta suggested to have a main restaurant for University students and staff during break, with the Vassallo group. Despite the initative being considered risky, the University went through with it for the students.</p>
        <p>During CampusHub's last stage of development, CampusEats underwent production upon opening, the establishment. Students flocked to CampusEats despite the initally small menu</p>
        <h2>CampusEats - A Success Story</h2>
        <p>Following CampusEats continued success in 2023, the menu was expanded to include a wider variety of dishes to please student's expectations. The university would then start a program that allows student associations to work with CampusEats as members of staff to gain work experience.</p>
    </div>
</div>
